translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Bu komponent versiya raqamini ko\'rsatmagan, shuning uchun u uchun tarjima so\'rab bo\'lmaydi.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Bu komponentning versiya raqami %d belgidan uzun, Babilim buni qayta ishlay olmaydi, shuning uchun u uchun tarjima so\'rab bo\'lmaydi.','A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now.'=>'Hozir bu saytda ushbu til uchun tarjima so\'rab bo\'lmaydi.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Rahmat. Xabaringiz yuborildi.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Bu xabarda to\'g\'ri plagin yoki mavzu va til ko\'rsatilmagan.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Iltimos, bu xabar uchun turkumni tanlang.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'Bu xabarda xabar beriladigan to\'g\'ri tuzilma ko\'rsatilmagan.','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Bu tuzilma ushbu sayt hozir bu komponent/til uchun biladigan tuzilmalardan biri emas.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'"%1$s" maydoni juda uzun: u %2$d belgidan iborat, chegara esa %3$d. Hech narsa yuborilmadi; iltimos, uni qisqartirib, qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Original string'=>'Asl satr','String context'=>'Satr konteksti','Current translation'=>'Joriy tarjima','Suggested translation'=>'Taklif etilgan tarjima','Note (optional)'=>'Izoh (ixtiyoriy)','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Buni qayerda ko\'rdingiz (ixtiyoriy)','Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s.'=>'Babilim sinxronlash jarayoni xizmat tomonidan vaqtincha kechiktirildi (so\'rovlar chastotasi cheklangan); %s dan keyin qayta urinib ko\'riladi.','The locale you added is not valid: use a WordPress locale code such as ll_CC (letters, digits, underscore, hyphen or @, at most %d characters). Nothing was saved.'=>'Siz qo\'shgan til yaroqsiz: ll_CC kabi WordPress til kodidan foydalaning (harflar, raqamlar, pastki chiziq, defis yoki @, ko\'pi bilan %d belgi). Hech narsa saqlanmadi.','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'Agar bu yoqilgan bo\'lsa, o\'chirish bu saytning identifikatorini ham o\'chirib tashlaydi. Shundan so\'ng bu saytga biriktirilgan pulli litsenziyani avtomatik tiklab bo\'lmaydi; uni qaytarib olish uchun %s manzili orqali Babilim qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qilishingiz kerak bo\'ladi.','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Babilim plagin o\'chirilganda bu saytning identifikatorini o\'chirib tashlashga sozlangan. Shundan so\'ng bu saytga biriktirilgan pulli litsenziyani avtomatik tiklab bo\'lmaydi; %s manzili orqali Babilim qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qilishingiz kerak bo\'ladi. Identifikatorni saqlab qolish uchun Bekor qilish tugmasini bosing, Babilim sozlamalarida "O\'chirishda Babilimning barcha ma\'lumotlarini o\'chirish" belgisini olib tashlang va qayta faolsizlantiring. Baribir faolsizlantirilsinmi?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Bu tarmoqda saytlar juda ko\'p, ularni birma-bir tekshirib bo\'lmaydi, ba\'zilari esa plagin o\'chirilganda o\'z Babilim identifikatorini o\'chirishga sozlangan bo\'lishi mumkin. Shundan so\'ng bunday saytga biriktirilgan pulli litsenziyani avtomatik tiklab bo\'lmaydi; Babilim qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga %s manzili orqali murojaat qilishingiz kerak bo\'ladi. Identifikatorlarni saqlab qolish uchun Bekor qilish tugmasini bosing, har bir saytning Babilim sozlamalarida "O\'chirishda Babilimning barcha ma\'lumotlarini o\'chirish" belgisini olib tashlang va qayta faolsizlantiring. Baribir faolsizlantirilsinmi?','Open Babilim settings'=>'Babilim sozlamalarini ochish','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim bu saytni tasdiqlay olmadi, shuning uchun hech narsa yuklab olinmaydi yoki o\'rnatilmaydi.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Xizmat saytingizga ulana olmadi. Ehtimol, xavfsizlik devori, xavfsizlik plagini yoki hosting qoidasi so\'rovni to\'sib qo\'ymoqda; iltimos, /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge manziliga so\'rovlarga ruxsat bering.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Saytingizning javob berishi juda uzoq vaqt oldi. Iltimos, keyinroq qayta urinib ko\'ring va hostingingiz juda sekin yoki haddan tashqari band emasligini tekshiring.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Saytingiz javob berdi, lekin kutilgan javob bilan emas. REST API boshqa plagin tomonidan o\'zgartirilgan bo\'lishi yoki bu endpoint keshlangan bo\'lishi mumkin; iltimos, /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge manzilini keshlash va qayta yozishdan chiqarib qo\'ying.','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Iltimos, saytingizga internetdan kirish mumkinligini tekshiring va qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Re-verify'=>'Qayta tasdiqlash','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Bu sayt xizmat bir sinxronlashda qabul qiladigan hajmdan oshib ketgan, shuning uchun ba\'zi elementlar qoldirildi: %1$d ta komponent va %2$d ta til.','This site is verified.'=>'Bu sayt tasdiqlangan.','Registration restarted.'=>'Ro\'yxatdan o\'tish qayta boshlandi.','Sync complete.'=>'Sinxronlash yakunlandi.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish.'=>'Babilim bu saytni yoqmoqda va tekshirmoqda… Bu sahifani qayta yuklang yoki rejalashtirilgan tekshiruv tugashini kuting.','Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s'=>'Babilim yoqishni yakunlay olmadi (%1$s): %2$s','A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step.'=>'Bir vaqtning o\'zida faqat bitta PHP so\'rovini bajaradigan hosting bu bosqichni yakunlay olmaydi.','Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working.'=>'Babilim o\'chirilgan. Boshqa hech narsa yuborilmaydi; allaqachon o\'rnatilgan tarjimalar ishlashda davom etadi.','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'Qo\'shimcha tarjima indeksi qayta qurildi.','Automatic installs are now off; turn them on again in the settings if you want them.'=>'Avtomatik o\'rnatishlar endi o\'chirilgan; xohlasangiz, sozlamalarda ularni qayta yoqing.','Babilim finds the plugins and themes on this site that have no translation for your language and installs one for each.'=>'Babilim bu saytdagi tilingiz uchun tarjimasi yo\'q plaginlar va mavzularni topadi hamda ularning har biriga tarjima o\'rnatadi.','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Bu saytda topilgan tillar: %s.','Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. After that, new translations and updates are installed automatically (on the free plan, only for plugins and themes that already use a free slot).'=>'Mavjud tarjimalarni bir bosishda o\'rnatish, yo\'qlarini esa so\'rash mumkin. Shundan so\'ng yangi tarjimalar va yangilanishlar avtomatik o\'rnatiladi (bepul tarifda faqat bepul o\'rindan allaqachon foydalanayotgan plaginlar va mavzular uchun).','The free plan covers a limited number of plugins and themes; your exact quota is shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'Bepul tarif cheklangan miqdordagi plaginlar va mavzularni qamrab oladi; aniq kvotangiz Babilim\'ni yoqqaningizdan keyin Sozlamalarda ko\'rsatiladi.','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Babilim\'ni yoqqaningizda nima yuboriladi','Enabling…'=>'Yoqilmoqda…','Enable Babilim'=>'Babilim\'ni yoqish','By clicking Enable, you agree to send the information listed above to Babilim.'=>'Yoqish tugmasini bosish orqali yuqorida sanab o\'tilgan ma\'lumotlarni Babilimga yuborishga rozilik bildirasiz.','Check again now'=>'Hozir qayta tekshirish','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… (last attempt: %s)'=>'Babilim bu saytni yoqmoqda va tekshirmoqda… (oxirgi urinish: %s)','Check again'=>'Qayta tekshirish','No components synced yet.'=>'Hali hech qanday komponent sinxronlanmagan.','Bulk %s:'=>'Ommaviy %s:','%1$s nothing to do.'=>'%1$s bajariladigan ish yo\'q.','%1$s %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s.','%1$s (%2$s): %3$s'=>'%1$s (%2$s): %3$s','Continuing…'=>'Davom etilmoqda…','Continue next batch (%d left)'=>'Keyingi to‘plamni davom ettirish (%d ta qoldi)','Search components'=>'Komponentlarni qidirish','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'Bu sayt foydalanadigan tillar. Ularni %s orqali o‘zgartirishingiz mumkin.','Upload this component?'=>'Ushbu komponent yuklansinmi?','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'Tasdiqlashni kutayotgan yuklash yo‘q.','Back'=>'Orqaga','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Ushbu komponentni tarjima qilish uchun Babilim uning manba kodiga muhtoj.','The entire plugin or theme directory of %1$s (version %2$s) will be uploaded to Babilim.'=>'%1$s (versiya %2$s) ning butun plagin yoki mavzu papkasi Babilim’ga yuklanadi.','If that directory contains keys, logs or customer data, they will be uploaded too. The service removes common sensitive files (configuration, environment, database dumps, logs, keys) but cannot guarantee it finds everything.'=>'Agar bu papkada kalitlar, jurnallar yoki mijoz ma’lumotlari bo‘lsa, ular ham yuklanadi. Xizmat odatiy maxfiy fayllarni (konfiguratsiya, muhit, ma’lumotlar bazasi nusxalari, jurnallar, kalitlar) olib tashlaydi, lekin hammasini topishiga kafolat bera olmaydi.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'Yuklangan fayllar siz Babilim’dan ularni o‘chirishni so‘ramaguningizcha saqlanadi.','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'U xizmatning xosting provayderi tomonidan saqlanadi va tarjimani yaratish uchun sun’iy intellekt modellari tomonidan qayta ishlanadi.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'Asl matn va undan yaratilgan tarjimalar xuddi shu versiyani o‘rnatadigan boshqa saytlarga taqdim etiladi.','By continuing you confirm that you have the right to upload this component.'=>'Davom etish orqali ushbu komponentni yuklash huquqiga ega ekanligingizni tasdiqlaysiz.','Upload and request'=>'Yuklash va so‘rash','Uploading…'=>'Yuklanmoqda…','Cancel'=>'Bekor qilish','Uploading'=>'Yuklanmoqda','There is no upload in progress.'=>'Davom etayotgan yuklash yo‘q.','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'%2$d qismdan %1$d-qism yuklanmoqda…','Continue'=>'Davom etish','Confirm'=>'Tasdiqlash','Remove'=>'Olib tashlash','Roll back'=>'Orqaga qaytarish','Nothing to confirm.'=>'Tasdiqlash uchun hech narsa yo‘q.','Choose a language'=>'Tilni tanlang','Roll back and report'=>'Orqaga qaytarish va xabar berish','Report a problem'=>'Muammo haqida xabar berish','Nothing to choose.'=>'Tanlash uchun hech narsa yo‘q.','%1$s: %2$s. Choose the language.'=>'%1$s: %2$s. Tilni tanlang.','Supplementary translations'=>'Qo‘shimcha tarjimalar','Each component\'s own contribution to each locale\'s shared default-domain supplement.'=>'Har bir komponentning har bir lokalning umumiy standart domen qo‘shimchasiga qo‘shgan o‘z hissasi.','Component'=>'Komponent','Language'=>'Til','Included in index'=>'Indeksga kiritilgan','Entries'=>'Yozuvlar','Conflicting keys'=>'Ziddiyatli kalitlar','Yes'=>'Ha','No — component inactive'=>'Yo\'q — komponent nofaol','No — installed version differs from the active one'=>'Yo\'q — o\'rnatilgan versiya faol versiyadan farq qiladi','No — component removed'=>'Yo\'q — komponent olib tashlangan','No'=>'Yo\'q','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'Buni faqat tarmoq administratori bajara oladi, chunki bu ushbu tarmoqdagi barcha saytlar uchun umumiy tarjima fayllarini o\'zgartiradi.','Babilim could not finish verifying this site (the service could not reach it back). Registration is paused.'=>'Babilim bu saytni tekshirishni yakunlay olmadi (xizmat saytga qayta ulana olmadi). Ro\'yxatdan o\'tkazish to\'xtatildi.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Bu saytda faol ro\'yxatdan o\'tish mavjud, uni endi avtomatik tiklab bo\'lmaydi.','Restart registration'=>'Ro\'yxatdan o\'tkazishni qayta boshlash','Babilim settings'=>'Babilim sozlamalari','General'=>'Umumiy','Advanced'=>'Qo\'shimcha','Languages'=>'Tillar','Automatic installs'=>'Avtomatik o\'rnatishlar','Install available translations automatically'=>'Mavjud tarjimalarni avtomatik o\'rnatish','On the free plan, only components that already use one of your free slots are installed automatically, so no new slot is taken.'=>'Bepul tarifda faqat bepul o\'rinlaringizdan birini allaqachon ishlatayotgan komponentlar avtomatik o\'rnatiladi, shuning uchun yangi o\'rin band qilinmaydi.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Bu sayt ko\'p saytli tarmoqning bir qismi bo\'lib, yangi tarjimalarni avtomatik o\'rnatmaydi. Allaqachon o\'rnatilgan tarjimalar baribir yangilanadi.','Custom overrides'=>'Maxsus almashtirishlar','Keep my own translation overrides when purging everything or uninstalling this plugin.'=>'Hammasini tozalashda yoki ushbu plaginni o\'chirishda o\'zimning tarjima almashtirishlarimni saqlab qolish.','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'%s papkasiga qo\'ygan tarjima fayllaringiz doim Babilim fayllaridan ustun turadi. Bu belgini olib tashlamasangiz, ular saqlanadi.','Uninstall'=>'O\'chirish','Delete all Babilim data on uninstall'=>'O\'chirishda Babilimning barcha ma\'lumotlarini o\'chirish','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'Odatda o\'chiq: plaginni o\'chirib tashlash bu saytning identifikatorini saqlab qoladi, shuning uchun qayta o\'rnatishda uni qayta ishlatish mumkin.','Account'=>'Hisob','Save changes'=>'O\'zgarishlarni saqlash','Disable Babilim'=>'Babilim\'ni o\'chirish','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'O\'rnatilgan tarjimalar saqlanadi, lekin boshqa tekshiruvlar va yuklab olishlar bajarilmaydi.','Disable Babilim? Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Babilim\'ni o\'chirasizmi? O\'rnatilgan tarjimalar saqlanadi, lekin boshqa tekshiruvlar va yuklab olishlar bajarilmaydi.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'Bu sayt hali Babilim\'da ro\'yxatdan o\'tmagan.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Bu saytga allaqachon litsenziya berilgan. Sahifani qayta yuklang.','Checkout is not available for this site right now.'=>'To\'lov sahifasi hozir bu sayt uchun mavjud emas.','Could not start checkout: %s'=>'To\'lov sahifasini boshlab bo\'lmadi: %s','Babilim is not enabled.'=>'Babilim yoqilmagan.','Not registered yet'=>'Hali ro\'yxatdan o\'tmagan','Not verified'=>'Tasdiqlanmagan','Verified'=>'Tasdiqlangan','Status'=>'Holati','Licensed'=>'Litsenziyalangan','Partner'=>'Hamkor','Free'=>'Bepul','License'=>'Litsenziya','Upgrade this site'=>'Ushbu saytni yangilash','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'Ushbu sayt uchun bir martalik xarid: %1$s %2$s. Barcha kelgusi tarjima yangilanishlarini o\'z ichiga oladi. To\'lovni Paddle yangi yorliqda amalga oshiradi.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Bu yangi tiklash kodini beradi va avvalgisi ishlamay qoladi. Davom etasizmi?','Show a new restore code'=>'Yangi tiklash kodini ko\'rsatish','rc_…'=>'rc_…','Restore code'=>'Tiklash kodi','Restore purchase'=>'Xaridni tiklash','Bought a license for this domain before? Enter the restore code you received at checkout.'=>'Bu domen uchun avval litsenziya sotib olganmisiz? To\'lov sahifasida olgan tiklash kodingizni kiriting.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Bu tiklash kodiga o\'xshamaydi.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Bu tiklash kodi ushbu sayt uchun tanilmadi.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Juda ko\'p urinish. Ertaga qayta urinib ko\'ring.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Avval ushbu sayt tasdiqlanishi kerak.','Could not restore the purchase: %s'=>'Xaridni tiklab bo\'lmadi: %s','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Xarid tiklandi. Endi bu sayt litsenziyalangan.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Bu saytda kod ko\'rsatiladigan xarid yo\'q.','Could not show a new restore code: %s'=>'Yangi tiklash kodini ko\'rsatib bo\'lmadi: %s','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Yangi tiklash kodingiz: %s. Uni xavfsiz joyda saqlang — avvalgi kod endi ishlamaydi.','What is sent when Babilim checks this site'=>'Babilim bu saytni tekshirganda nima yuboriladi','(detected)'=>'(aniqlangan)','No language is managed yet.'=>'Hozircha birorta til boshqarilmaydi.','Babilim adds translations for every language checked here.'=>'Babilim bu yerda belgilangan har bir til uchun tarjimalar qo\'shadi.','Add another language'=>'Yana til qo\'shish','Choose a language…'=>'Tilni tanlang…','Could not load the full WordPress.org locale list from the service, so no other language can be added right now.'=>'Xizmatdan WordPress.org lokallarining to\'liq ro\'yxatini yuklab bo\'lmadi, shuning uchun hozir boshqa til qo\'shib bo\'lmaydi.','Theme'=>'Mavzu','Plugin'=>'Plagin','Free quota'=>'Bepul kvota','Downloads: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)'=>'Yuklab olishlar: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)','Supplementary translation index'=>'Qo\'shimcha tarjima indeksi','Built'=>'Yaratilgan','Included'=>'Kiritilgan','Excluded'=>'Chiqarib tashlangan','Already in WordPress core'=>'WordPress yadrosida allaqachon mavjud','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Qo\'shimcha tarjimalarga xizmat ko\'rsatish','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'Xizmat ko\'rsatish holati hozir mavjud emas.','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'Tozalash %1$s da to\'xtatildi: %2$s. Hech narsa o\'chirilmadi.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'Oxirgi tozalash %1$s: %2$d ta yangi belgilandi, %3$d ta fayl o\'chirildi, %4$d ta yozuv olib tashlandi.','No cleanup has run yet.'=>'Hali tozalash bajarilmagan.','A translation-index write conflicted with another request on %1$s (%2$s) and was not applied; the most recent version