r tanlangan komponentning tanlangan tiliga qo\'llanadi.','Version %s'=>'Versiya %s','Theme · %s'=>'Mavzu · %s','Plugin · %s'=>'Plagin · %s','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'%1$s komponentining %2$s tilidagi tarjimasi bu saytdan olib tashlansinmi?','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'%1$s komponentining %2$s tilidagi tarjimasi oldingi tuzilmaga orqaga qaytarilsinmi?','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s: %2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'Ro\'yxatdan o\'tish uchun tekshiruv topshirig\'i kutilgan shaklda emas.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Bu yaroqli tuzilma identifikatori emas.','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'Babilim til fayllari katalogidan tashqariga yozishdan bosh tortildi.','Could not write the downloaded package to disk.'=>'Yuklab olingan paketni diskka yozib bo\'lmadi.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Kutilmagan HTTP %d javobi.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'Ushbu saytning URL manzili, shunda xizmat sizga tegishli ekanini tekshira oladi.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'WordPress versiyangiz, mos tarjima fayllarini taqdim etish uchun.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'PHP versiyangiz, moslik uchun.','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'Ushbu plaginning o\'z versiyasi, shunda u juda eski bo\'lib, xizmat bilan aloqa qila olmasa, xizmat uni yangilashni aytishi mumkin.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'Ushbu saytning sozlangan lokali.','Every locale in use on this site (site locale, installed language packs, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'Ushbu saytda ishlatilayotgan barcha lokallar (sayt lokali, o\'rnatilgan til paketlari, foydalanuvchi lokallari va qo\'lda qo\'shganlaringiz). Barcha lokallarga bir xil munosabatda bo\'linadi.','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'(ushbu sayt uchun yaratilgan ochiq kalit)','This site\'s install public key, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent.'=>'Ushbu saytning o\'rnatish ochiq kaliti, so\'rovlar haqiqatan ham shu saytdan kelganini isbotlash uchun ishlatiladi. Faqat ochiq qismi yuboriladi.','Every installed plugin/theme: its slug, version, text domain(s), whether it\'s a wp.org listing, its own bundled locales, and which locales you\'ve already installed a Babilim translation for.'=>'Har bir o\'rnatilgan plagin/mavzu: uning slugi, versiyasi, text domain(lar)i, wp.org ro\'yxatidagi ekani, o\'zining ichki lokallari va qaysi lokallar uchun Babilim tarjimasini allaqachon o\'rnatganingiz.','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: that component\'s entire directory, as a zip.'=>'Faqat WordPress.org\'da bo\'lmagan plagin yoki mavzu uchun yuklashni tasdiqlaganingizda: ushbu komponentning butun katalogi zip ko\'rinishida.','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(faqat umumiy kodlar va koordinatalar)','Up to 20 pending diagnostic events (e.g. a file that failed its integrity check), each just a code, component, and locale, and never any string content or translated text.'=>'Kutilayotgan 20 tagacha diagnostika hodisasi (masalan, yaxlitlikni tekshirishdan o\'tmagan fayl haqidagi hodisa). Har biri faqat kod, komponent va lokaldan iborat bo\'lib, hech qachon satrlar mazmuni yoki tarjima matnini o\'z ichiga olmaydi.','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Xavfli lokal: %s','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'Manifest mavjud emas: %s','Could not determine active components; the existing merged index was left unchanged.'=>'Faol komponentlarni aniqlab bo\'lmadi; mavjud birlashtirilgan indeks o\'zgartirilmadi.','Could not determine installed plugins/themes; sweep skipped, nothing was deleted.'=>'O\'rnatilgan plagin/mavzularni aniqlab bo\'lmadi; tozalash o\'tkazib yuborildi, hech na