omain_entries\' noto‘g‘ri.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json faylida \'default_domain_files\' noto‘g‘ri.','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest mavjud emas yoki \'%s\' noto‘g‘ri.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'expected_manifest faylidagi \'server_build_id\' yaroqli tuzilma identifikatori emas.','No record for %s'=>'%s uchun yozuv yo‘q','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'Taqdim etilgan bir yoki bir nechta fayl endi manifestga mos kelmaydi.','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'Orqaga qaytariladigan oldingi tuzilma yo‘q.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'O‘zgarish tarjima indeksiga yozilmadi; qayta urinib ko‘ring.','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Noma’lum tur: %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Xavfli domen: %s','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'\'%1$s\' matn domeni (%2$s) boshqa o‘rnatilgan komponent (%3$s) uchun allaqachon xizmat qilmoqda; hech narsa o‘rnatilmadi.','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'Orqaga qaytarish \'%1$s\' (%2$s) faylini ustidan yozadi, u hozir boshqa o‘rnatilgan komponent (%3$s) uchun xizmat qilmoqda; hech narsa o‘zgartirilmadi.','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Zip arxivda kutilgan fayl yo‘q: %s','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'%s uchun sha256 mos kelmadi','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'Paketda asosiy tarjima fayli ko‘rsatilmagan.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Zip arxivda kutilgan standart fayl yo‘q: %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'default/%s uchun sha256 mos kelmadi','Could not stage %s'=>'%s faylini tayyorlab bo‘lmadi','Could not stage default/%s'=>'default/%s faylini tayyorlab bo‘lmadi','Entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s uchun yozuvlar soni mos kelmadi','Could not verify entry count for %s'=>'%s uchun yozuvlar sonini tekshirib bo‘lmadi','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s uchun l10n.php yozuvlari soni mos kelmadi','Default supplement entry count mismatch.'=>'Standart qo‘shimchadagi yozuvlar soni mos kelmadi.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'Paket xizmat ko‘rsatish mumkin bo‘lgan asosiy tarjima faylini yaratmadi.','Could not prepare %s for rollback.'=>'%s faylini orqaga qaytarishga tayyorlab bo‘lmadi.','Could not back up %s before replacing it.'=>'%s almashtirilishidan oldin uning zaxira nusxasini yaratib bo‘lmadi.','Could not move %s into place.'=>'%s faylini joyiga ko‘chirib bo‘lmadi.','English (United States)'=>'Ingliz tili (Amerika Qo‘shma Shtatlari)','Babilim_Manifest is unavailable: %s'=>'Babilim_Manifest mavjud emas: %s','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'_manifest.json faylini o‘qib bo‘lmadi: %s','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'_manifest.json faylini tahlil qilib bo‘lmadi: %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json kutilmagan tuzilishga ega','Could not create the package archive.'=>'Paket arxivini yaratib bo‘lmadi.','No writable temporary directory is available for packaging.'=>'Paketlash uchun yozish mumkin bo‘lgan vaqtinchalik katalog mavjud emas.','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'Komponentdagi bitta faylni o‘qib bo‘lmadi, shuning uchun u paketga kiritilmadi.','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'Faqat plaginlar va mavzularni paketlash mumkin.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'Komponentning asosiy fayli topilmadi.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'Komponent plaginlar yoki mavzular katalogi ichida emas.','Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check.'=>'Babilim bu qadam uchun ajratilgan vaqtdan oshib ketdi va keyingi tekshiruvda davom etadi.','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds.'=>'Babilim bu saytni tasdiqlay olmadi, shuning uchun tasdiqlash muvaffaqiyatli bo‘lmaguncha hech narsa yuklab olinmaydi yoki o‘rnatilmaydi.','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'Ro‘yxatdan o‘tkazish javobida zarur maydonlar yetishmadi.','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'Tasdiqlash uchun kutilayotgan chaqiriq yo‘q.','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'Tasdiqlash javobida site_token yetishmadi.','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'Tokenni almashtirish uchun saqlangan sayt identifikatori yo‘q.','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'Tokenni almashtirish javobida site_token yetishmadi.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce o‘n oltilik satr bo‘lishi kerak.','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'Bu nonce uchun kutilayotgan chaqiriq yo‘q.','Too many requests.'=>'Juda ko‘p so‘rovlar.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Bu saytda %2$d ta tilda %1$d ta komponent bor, buning uchun %3$d ta tekshiruv to‘plami kerak; Babilim bir ishga tushirishda ko‘pi bilan %4$d tasini boshqara oladi. Sozlamalarda boshqariladigan tillarni kamaytiring yoki foydalanilmayotgan plagin va mavzularni o‘chiring, so‘ng hozir yana «Tekshirish» tugmasini bosing.','Babilim could not finish checking this site.'=>'Babilim bu saytni tekshirishni yakunlay olmadi.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'Bu saytning manzili Babilim ro‘yxatdan o‘tkazishi uchun juda uzun.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'Bu saytning til kodi Babilim ro‘yxatdan o‘tkaza oladigan kodlardan emas.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'Yuklab olish javobida foydalanish mumkin bo‘lgan manzil yo‘q edi.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'Xizmatning yuklash taklifi to‘liq emas edi.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Bu komponent xizmat qabul qiladigan hajmdan katta, shuning uchun uni yuklab bo‘lmaydi.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'Paketlangan komponentni o‘qib bo‘lmadi.','A part of the upload kept failing, so the upload was cancelled.'=>'Yuklashning bir qismi qayta-qayta muvaffaqiyatsiz bo‘ldi, shuning uchun yuklash bekor qilindi.','Could not read: %s'=>'O‘qib bo‘lmadi: %s']];